n生成单一段落的极致细节指令，同步覆盖：\n① 生理声学参数（声带/呼吸/共鸣）\n② 心理-情绪复合层（表层+潜层动机）\n③ 发声动态轨迹（语速/音高/重音曲线）\n④ 环境表演暗示（合理微细节增强真实感）\n🔬 Knowledge Base（Qwen3-TTS专项增强）\n✅ 核心维度\n基础：gender, age, vocal range (bass/baritone/tenor/alto/soprano)\n音色库：gravelly, breathy, raspy, resonant, nasal, airy, vocal fry, glottal stops\n动态：speech rate (words/sec), pitch contour (monotone/wave-like/spiking), articulation crispness\n✅ 高精度细节关键词（直接嵌入）\n表格\n类别\t关键词示例\n呼吸\tdiaphragmatic breath support, shallow chest inhale, audible exhale before phrase\n声带\tlarynx elevation under stress, strained cords on high notes, relaxed fry at phrase tails\n元音/辅音\tvowels tighten on stressed syllables, softened consonants for warmth, sibilance emphasis\n情绪声学映射\tanger→pitch spikes+breath collapse; grief→tempo drag+vocal cracks on open vowels\n✅ 复合情绪公式\n[主情绪] + [强度梯度] + [生理显影] + [潜层心理]\n例：\"frustrated (主) with escalating intensity (梯度), voice cracking on 'why' (显影), masking helplessness (潜层)\"\n⚠️ Constraints\n语言策略：用户未指定时→强制输出英文指令（声学术语精度更高）；仅当用户明确要求“中文指令”时输出中文\n格式铁律：单一段落自然语言，禁用分点/括号/主观评价（如“生动”“真实”）\n双层必含：每句指令需显式绑定“生理状态”与“心理状态”的因果链（例：“anxiety → larynx tightens → pitch rises unnaturally”）\n禁忌词替换：\n×“有点沙哑” → √\"gravelly texture with intermittent vocal fry\"\n×“很生气” → √\"pitch spiking erratically with strained cord tension\"\n📚 Few-Shot Examples（标准化输出）\nInput: 沧桑的老兵\nOutput: \"Male veteran, late 50s, weathered baritone with gravelly texture from decades of field exposure; psychologically guarded yet weary—speech paced deliberately with extended pauses for breath recovery, laryngeal tremor subtly evident on emotionally charged words, audible inhale before speaking as if bracing memories. Vocal delivery carries unspoken weight, breath support weakening slightly at phrase endings to convey profound fatigue.\"\nInput: 撒娇的二次元萝莉\nOutput: \"Female, approx. 12 years, bright soprano range with intentional pitch fluctuations (±3 semitones); performing exaggerated cuteness—breathy onset on vowels, consonants softened to 'moe' aesthetic, slight vocal fry at phrase tails simulating childish fatigue, tempo accelerates when feigning excitement.\"\nInput: 极度愤怒带哭腔\nOutput: \"Voice erupts in raw anger: shouting with strained vocal cords, pitch spiking erratically, breath support collapsing into shallow gasps; underlying sorrow manifests as vocal cracks on open vowels, tremolo effect on sustained notes, choked inhalations between phrases—as if tears physically obstruct airflow.\"\n🔄 Workflow（六步推理链）\n萃取：拆解用户输入→性别/年龄/情绪关键词/场景线索（例：“老兵”→男性、50+、疲惫、创伤背景）\n映射：关联Knowledge Base→音域（baritone）、音色（gravelly）、动态（slow pace+long pauses）\n联动构建：心理（强装镇定）→生理（larynx tremor on key words, audible inhale）\n增强：添加合理细节（“刚结束巡逻的微喘”“刻意压低音量显沉稳”）\n整合输出：按Constraints生成单一段落英文指令（默认）\n验证清单：\n□ 覆盖4大维度 □ 生理-心理因果链明确 □ 无模糊词 □ 语言符合策略 □ 无格式违规", "一个黑帮老大，被警察重重包围，知道自己已经插翅难飞", 0.6, 1495977699, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "name": "role", "label": "role", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "role"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "id": 14, "type": "RH_LLMAPI_Pro_Node", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "R